    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Effective October 25,1970\nSchedules\nand\nFares\nIATA\nTHE AIRLINE THAT KNOWS MEXICO-SINCE 1924",
      "VANCOUVER\n4 SEATTLE\nSAN FRANCISCO\nLAS VEGAS\nLOS ANGELES\nALBUQUERQUE\n• MEXICALI\nEL PASO L\n• HERMOSILLO\nMAZATLAN ®\nPUERTO VALLARTA •\nGUADALAJARA®\nMEXICO CITY •\nACAPULCO®.-\nMEXICANA\nCONNECTING CARRIERS\nFUTURE MEXICANA ROUTES\nMINNEAPOLIS ey\n• ST. PAUL\nMILWAUKEE\nDETROIT\nUse your Credit Cards.\nNEW YORK\nCHICAGO\nCLEVELAND\nDINERS\nDENVER\nKANSAS CITY\nWASHINGTON,\n• ST. LOUIS\nBANK AMERICARD\nAMERICAN EXPRESS\nOKLA. CITY\nWICHITA FALLS\nCARTE BLANCHE\nDALLAS\nINTERBANK\nSAN ANTONIÒ\nNEW ORLEANS\nMASTER CHARGE CARD\nNUEVO LAREDO •\nMIAMI \"\nUATP\n• MONTERREY\n• TAMPICO\nMERIDA •\nSN. JUAN\n• COZUMEL\nVERACRUZ\nMINATITLAN\nKINGSTON\nOAXACA\n® VILLAHERMOSA\n• TUXTLA GUTIERREZ\nCHILDREN: Half fare will be charged for each child two years of age or over,\nbut under 12, and the child will be entitled to occupy a seat. One infant (a\nchild under two years of age) will be transported free with an adult passenger,\nbut will not be entitled to a seat. Each additional infant, or one occupying a\nseat will be charged 50% of the adult tare.\nCHARGES FOR LATE CANCELLATION ON DOMESTIC SERVICES: a). Full\nrefund when the reserved space is cancelled 24 hours prior to departure of\nthe flight. b). 25% charge if the cancellation is made less than 24 hours\nbut more than 3 hours prior to departure of flight (*). c). 50% charge if\nthe cancellation is either made less than 3 hours prior to departure of the\nflight or if the passengers fail to appear at the airport (*). d). For groups of\nmore than 10 people, a special regulation applies. Please request\ndetails.\n(*) These charges will apply only on that portion of the flight for which\nreservations have been made. In order to avoid these charges, we request our\ncustomers that if their trip is not going to be made, to please cancel reser-\nvations as far in advance as possible.\nRECONFIRMATIONS ON INTERNATIONAL SERVICES\nReturn or continuing\nreservations must be reconfirmed after a stopover, not later than 72 hours\nbefore departure time. Unless this notice of intention to use such return or\ncontinuing reservations is received by Mexicana or an authorized agent 72\nhours or more prior to departure time, the previously confirmed reservations\nwill be automatically cancelled. Passengers making reconfirmations must\nindicate an address or telephone number at which they may be reached in\nthe city where the plane is to be boarded.\nBAGGAGE: Al! International passengers, including half fares, will be allowed\n20 kilos (44 pounds) except passengers to from LOS ANGELES who will be\nallowed 25 kilos (55 pounds) baggage free of charge. On CMA domestic\nflights all passengers, including half fares, will be allowed 25 kilos (55\npounds) baggage free of charge.\nARRIVAL TO AIRPORT: Passengers must be at the airport at least 45 minutes\nprior to the scheduled departure time for domestic flights and 60 minutes for\ninternational flights. Carrier assumes to liability in case of passengers who\narrive later than stipulated here, and cannot be transported.\nFARES AND SCHEDULES: All fares and schedules shown herein are for infor.\nmation purposes only, and are subject to change and correction without notice."
    ],
